      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9xk",
          "text": "If you or a loved one are seriously hurt in an accident through no fault of your own, contact the personal injury attorneys at Dormer Harpring. We represent people from all walks of life who need compensation for medical expenses, property damage, lost income, pain and suffering, and other damages resulting from personal injury accidents.",
