      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9xy",
          "text": "A personal injury attorney is an essential asset to your claim. The insurance companies have adjusters and teams of lawyers at their disposal whose only job is to settle and litigate injury claims. You need the same level of professionalism on your side.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
