        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9z6",
          "text": "Most personal injury claims involve a catastrophic injury. This is a severe injury requiring long-term, extensive medical treatment, including surgery. Catastrophic injury often includes pain and suffering, along with financial burdens and emotional trauma.",
          "marks": []
